    "notes": "Drums: Superior Drummer 3 (instruments/superior-drummer-3.json) — a metal kit (e.g. Metal Foundry / Hard Rock SDX) on the default map. Guitars: Solemn Tones Odin III (instruments/odin-iii.json) set to drop C, Amped Rhythm or Clean DI into an amp sim; L/R takes on separate instances or the dual panned preset. Bass: DI + distorted layer, any bass VST on GM-style note numbers. Pad: optional strings under choruses."
  },
  "notes": "Riff-first layer order: rhythm_guitar renders before drums so breakdown kicks (kick_follow) and the bass (style 'doubled') lock to the chugs. Rhythm guitars are double-tracked with per-section take relationships. Render the whole song with --form."
}
